              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Mpwemu w’Imana aza kuri Zekariya mwene Yehoyada umuherezi; ahagarara ahataramutse imbere y’abantu, arababarira, at’ Uku ni k’Uhoraho Imana agize, ngo N’iki kibateye gucumura ku vyagezwe vyiwe, bikababuza kuroranirwa? Ko mwahevye Uhoraho na we arabahevye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
