              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uko ni k’umwami Yowasi atibutse ineza Yehoyada se w’uwo Zekariya yamugiriye, akamwicira uwo mwana wiwe nyene. Akirikw arapfa, yaravuze, at’ Uhoraho n’arābe ibi, abihōre.",
          "type": "text",
