        {
          "text": "Maz’ uwo mwaka ushize, ingabo z’Abasiriya ziradūga, zitera Yowasi. Bashika i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu, bageseza abaganwa bose bo mu gihugu, barabamara, barungikira umwami w’i Damasiko iminyago yose babanyaze. ",
