        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma bahindukiye bamuvuyeko, basize arwaye asinzikaye, abantu bo mu banyarugo biwe bgite baramugarariza, bamutsinda ku kirwa ciwe, arapfa, kubg’ amaraso ya mwene Yehoyada umuherezi yavishije; baraheza bamuhamba ku murwa wa Dawidi, ariko ntibamuhamba mu mva z’ abandi bami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.25"
            ]
