          "text": "Nukw ivy’ abahungu biwe, n’imbūri nyinshi yabūriwe, n’ ingene yasanishije ingoro y’Imana, biranditswe mu bidōnda inkuru vyo mu gitabo c’abami. Maz’ umuhungu wiwe Amaziya asubira ku ngoma yiwe.",
